SUMMARY:🎃🍂 Halloween Day: The Fall Colours of High Park & Ghost Stor
 ies 👻
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🎃
 🍂 Halloween Day: The Fall Colours of High Park & Ghost Stories 👻\n\n
 ### Fall Colours\, Spooky Stories & A Little Halloween Fun\n\nIt's Hallowe
 en — so why should the ghosts get to have all the fun at night?\n\nJoin 
 us for a **Halloween Day walk through High Park**\, where we'll enjoy the 
 fall colours while stopping along the way for some of the park's stranger\
 , spookier\, and downright weird stories.\nHigh Park has a long history of
  ghost stories and local legends.\n\nFrom stories connected to the **War o
 f 1812** — yes\, *that* War of 1812 — to tales of mysterious deaths an
 d people who may not have completely left the park behind\, there's plenty
  of history to make an ordinary fall walk a little more interesting.\nBut 
 don't worry.\n\n**This isn't a terrifying ghost hunt.**\n\nIt's Halloween 
 in the middle of the day. 👻☀️\nThink **fall colours\, creepy storie
 s\, a few laughs\, and just enough spooky atmosphere to make you look over
  your shoulder once or twice.**\n\n📱 Don't forget to join our **WhatsAp
 p Group – [CLICK HERE](https://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc)
 **\n\n***\n\n## 👻 What We'll Do\n\nWe'll walk through **High Park**\, s
 topping at different locations along the way while I share stories connect
 ed to the park's history and ghostly legends.\nAlong the way we'll:\n\n* E
 njoy the fall colours 🍂\n* Explore some of High Park's most interesting
  locations\n* Hear stories of ghosts\, legends\, and strange events 👻\n
 * Learn a little about the park's history\n* Take photos and enjoy the sce
 nery 📸\n* Have some Halloween fun along the way 🎃\n\nWe'll keep a st
 eady walking pace\, with regular stops for storytelling.\nThe walk will re
 main **outside throughout** — there is no entry into buildings.\n\n***\n
 \n## 🎃 Halloween Day — So Let's Have Some Fun\n\nThis isn't meant to 
 be a serious paranormal investigation.\nIt's a **Halloween walk**.\n\nSome
  stories are creepy. Some are strange. Some might make you wonder whether 
 there's actually something going on.\nAnd some are just a good excuse to t
 ell a spooky story while walking through the fall leaves.\n\n**You don't h
 ave to believe in ghosts.**\nYou just have to enjoy a good story.\n\n***\n
 \n## 🍁 Fall Weather & Expectations\n\nThis is an outdoor walk\, so plea
 se dress appropriately for the weather.\nHigh Park can be cool and damp in
  late October\, so bring a warm jacket and wear comfortable walking shoes.
 \nWe'll be walking at a steady pace\, with stops along the way for stories
  and photos.\n\n***\n\n## 🧢 Meetup Details\n\n📍 **Meetup Location:**
  High Park sign on the west side at Bloor Street West & High Park Avenue\n
 🫎 **Look for me in my Moose Hat!**\n⏰ **Meetup Time:** **11:00 AM sha
 rp**\nI will only wait **5 minutes.**\n**Early is on time. On time is late
 .**\n🚶 **Pace:** Steady walking pace\n🏁 **End Point:** Back where we
  started\n\n***\n\n## 🎟️ Meetup Fee\n\n**$10 cash in person or e-tran
 sfer**\n📧 **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**\nThis is a **curated\, guided s
 torytelling experience**\, rather than one of our regular group walks. The
  route\, stories\, and history have been researched and developed specific
 ally for this experience.\n\n***\n\n## 🎒 What to Bring\n\n💧 Water\n
 👟 Comfortable walking shoes\n🧥 Warm fall jacket or layers\n📸 Came
 ra or phone\n🎃 Halloween spirit\nAnd if you want to wear a costume...\n
 **I'm certainly not going to stop you.** 👻\n\n***\n\n## 🌈 Who Is Thi
 s For?\n\nThis is great for:\n\n* People who love Halloween 🎃\n* Anyone
  who enjoys ghost stories\n* Fall-colour enthusiasts 🍂\n* History buffs
 \n* People looking for something different to do on Halloween Day\n* Anyon
 e who enjoys a good story and a few laughs\n* People who want to meet new 
 people while exploring Toronto\n\nYou're welcome to RSVP ahead of time or 
 just show up on the day if you're unsure about your schedule.\nSometimes t
 hings happen and events may need to be cancelled or changed\, so please ke
 ep an eye on the event page for updates.\n\n👤 **Organizer: Mathew**\nQu
 estions? Post on the event wall or email **torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail
 .com**\n\n**Come for the fall colours.** 🍂\n**Stay for the ghost storie
 s.** 👻\n**Leave with a new connection — if the ghosts don't get you f
 irst.** 🎃
