SUMMARY:🎷 Jazz Night @ Junction Underground! 🎷
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🎷 **
 Jazz Night @ Junction Underground!** 🎷\n\nSlip into something smooth an
 d join us for a night of *live jazz\, soulful vocals\, and good company* a
 t one of the Junction’s coolest hidden gems — **Junction Underground**
 .\n\nWe’ll be treated to some *incredible up-and-coming jazz performers*
 \, each bringing their own flavour of swing\, blues\, and smoky charm to t
 he stage. And yes — **I’ll be singing too!** Think torch songs\, scatt
 ing\, and a whole lot of sass.\n\nLet's time we had this evenr members had
  a great time!\n\n✨ Expect:\n\n* **Cool sounds. Cool cats. Cooler vibes.
 **\n* A cozy\, speakeasy-style venue.\n* A chance to meet fun\, music-lovi
 ng people (single\, social\, or just jazz-curious).\n\n🎶 **Event Detail
 s**\n🕢 Meetup Time: 7:45 PM\n🚪 Doors Open: 8:00 PM\n🎤 Show Starts
 : 8:30 PM\n⏱️ Run Time: 3 hours 30mins (with a chill intermission)\n
 💸 Cost: **$15 plus fees.** – Don’t wait\, tickets are limited\nTick
 ets - [CLICK HERE ](https://www.centrestageexperience.com/event-details/no
 vember-jazz-night)\n\n📍 Venue: **Junction Underground** (details below)
 \n\n**Please note:** Seating is limited — it’s part of the intimate vi
 be — so you might need to stand (and sway).\n\nThis is a *laid-back perf
 ormance*\, perfect for music lovers\, first dates\, or anyone who wants to
  unwind midweek with great tunes and great people.\n\n💬 I’ll be insid
 e to greet everyone — watch for an update on where to find me!\n\n🎟
 ️ Tickets must be purchased before signing up\, but you can always *just
  show up the day of* if you’re feeling spontaneous.\n\nThis group is ope
 n to *everyone* — social butterflies\, new friends\, singles\, couples\,
  and anyone who loves discovering Toronto’s arts\, culture\, movies\, hi
 kes\, and food spots.\n\n— *Mathew (your songer & crooner for the evenin
 g)*\n📧 Contact: torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com
