SUMMARY:🎶 Niagara Falls Concert Road Trip: Roch Voisine at OLG Stage! $
 50 total
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🎶 
 Niagara Falls Concert Road Trip: Roch Voisine at OLG Stage!\n\n**Friday\, 
 November 13\, 2026**\nReady for a night of great music and a little Niagar
 a Falls adventure? Join us for a road trip from Toronto to see **Roch Vois
 ine – The Lightfoot Sessions Live** at the **OLG Stage at Fallsview Casi
 no**! 🎤🎶\n\n### 🎵 The Concert\n\nRoch Voisine brings **The Lightf
 oot Sessions Live** to Niagara Falls for a special evening celebrating his
  incredible career and the music of Canadian legend **Gordon Lightfoot**.\
 nVoisine is one of Canada's best-known singer-songwriters\, with a career 
 spanning four decades and 25 albums. His massive breakthrough came with *H
 élène*\, which went triple platinum in Canada and diamond in France.\nTh
 e show will feature Roch's greatest hits along with his tribute to Gordon 
 Lightfoot. 🇨🇦🎶\n**Concert:** Roch Voisine – The Lightfoot Sessi
 ons Live\n**Date:** Friday\, November 13\, 2026\n**Venue:** OLG Stage at F
 allsview Casino\n**Showtime:** 8:00 PM\n👉 **Official show information:*
 *\n[https://fallsviewcasinoresort.com/events-and-promotions/schedule-of-ev
 ents/roch-voisine.html](https://fallsviewcasinoresort.com/events-and-promo
 tions/schedule-of-events/roch-voisine.html)\n\n### 🚗 The Road Trip\n\nW
 e'll meet **outside Christie Station at 4:30 PM** and head to Niagara Fall
 s in a **Kia Soul with SiriusXM radio**.\nDepending on traffic and how the
  evening is going\, we may have some time to **sightsee around Niagara Fal
 ls before the concert**. 🌊📸\nAfter the show\, we'll head back to Tor
 onto.\n**Expected return to Toronto: around 11:30 PM**\, depending on traf
 fic and the timing of the evening.\n\n### 💰 COST: JUST $50\n\n**$50 inc
 ludes:**\n\n* 🎟️ Your concert ticket\n* 🚗 Round-trip transportatio
 n from Toronto\n* ⛽ Transportation costs\n\nThat's it — **just $50 for
  the concert AND the ride!**\n\n### 📲 RESERVE YOUR SPOT\n\nSpots are **
 very limited** because we're travelling in a Kia Soul.\nTo reserve your sp
 ot\, send **$50 by e-transfer to:**\nnicolasbello@yahoo.com\n\nYour spot i
 s only locked in once the e-transfer has been received.\n\n### 🍁 Come f
 or the concert. Stay for the road trip.\n\nLet's make a night of it — gr
 eat music\, Niagara Falls\, SiriusXM on the drive\, and a fun Meetup road 
 trip with a small group!\n\n**Friday\, November 13 • 4:30 PM departure 
 • Christie Station**\n🎶 **Roch Voisine + Niagara Falls + Road Trip = 
 Friday night plans!**
